The '''Doge Base''' (わんこの城 ''Wanko no Shiro'', '''Doggy's Castle''') is an animated [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Doge Base
|image = E 315.png
|first appearance = '''SoL''': [[Multiversal Studios|Sub-chapter 37 - Multiversal Studios]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL:''' [[Candy Downpour|Sub-chapter 12 - Candy Downpour]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
Very similar to the [[Corrupted Cat Base (Enemy Base)|Corrupted Cat Base]], Doge Base is a Single Target [[:Category:Typeless Enemies|Typeless]] enemy with high range and fires off an extremely damaging level 20 [[Wave Attack]], having enough reach to cover the entire stage in all its appearances. Though it never is the main threat, the support enemies usually featured are more than compensation.

==Strategy==
It has to hit a cat unit for its wave to occur. As such, if your wave blocker is positioned correctly or you have multiple out at once, it will only destroy one of your frontline units before the wave itself gets neutralized. Otherwise, it will simply destroy everything on the field that isn't immune to waves. Depending on stage length, fighting outside of its range is another possible option.

As with most animated bases, the Doge Base lacks both [[:Category:Enemies with Surge Immunity|Surge]] and [[:Category:Enemies with Explosion Immunity|Explosion Immunity]], so it will take the additional damage from units that have those abilities, such as [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

